<section class="common-issues">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Common Electrical Problems We Fix</h2>
        
        <div class="issues-grid">
            
            <div class="issue-card">
                <h4>Dead Battery</h4>
                <p class="symptom">Symptom: Car won't start, clicking sound, no electrical power</p>
                <p class="cause">Cause: Old battery, parasitic drain, charging system failure, leaving lights on</p>
                <p class="solution">Solution: Battery testing, replacement if needed, charging system diagnosis</p>
            </div>

            <div class="issue-card">
                <h4>Alternator Failure</h4>
                <p class="symptom">Symptom: Battery light on, dimming lights, electrical accessories failing, battery keeps dying</p>
                <p class="cause">Cause: Worn alternator bearings, failed voltage regulator, broken drive belt</p>
                <p class="solution">Solution: Alternator testing and replacement, belt inspection</p>
            </div>

            <div class="issue-card">
                <h4>Starter Problems</h4>
                <p class="symptom">Symptom: Engine won't crank, clicking noise when starting, intermittent starting</p>
                <p class="cause">Cause: Worn starter motor, failed solenoid, loose connections, bad ignition switch</p>
                <p class="solution">Solution: Starter testing, solenoid replacement, connection repair</p>
            </div>

            <div class="issue-card">
                <h4>Wiring Issues</h4>
                <p class="symptom">Symptom: Intermittent electrical problems, blown fuses, accessories not working</p>
                <p class="cause">Cause: Damaged wiring, corrosion, rodent damage, loose connections</p>
                <p class="solution">Solution: Circuit testing, wiring repair or replacement, connector cleaning</p>
            </div>

            <div class="issue-card">
                <h4>Lighting Failures</h4>
                <p class="symptom">Symptom: Headlights not working, tail lights out, dashboard lights dim or off</p>
                <p class="cause">Cause: Burnt bulbs, bad switches, wiring problems, fuse issues</p>
                <p class="solution">Solution: Bulb replacement, switch testing, circuit repair</p>
            </div>

            <div class="issue-card">
                <h4>Computer System Errors</h4>
                <p class="symptom">Symptom: Warning lights on, poor performance, features not working</p>
                <p class="cause">Cause: Failed sensors, communication errors, module failures, software issues</p>
                <p class="solution">Solution: Diagnostic scanning, sensor replacement, module programming</p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>

